THE OOGA BOOGA LICENSE

OOGA BOOGA. Me make code. Me give code to tribe.

You take code. You copy code. You change code. You share code. You sell code.
You put code in bigger code. You make shiny. Or no shiny. Me no care.
No ask. No pay. No club.

Me throw away all "mine."
Code for all tribe, now and after me become bone.
Me child no come later with club and bill.

Code come how code come.
Maybe work. Maybe no work. Maybe eat wallet.
Me promise nothing.

Code break? Not me fault.
Coin fall in river? Not me fault.
Mammoth step on laptop? Very not me fault.

You use code, you take chance.
You no blame me. You no sue me. You get no shiny from me.

Take fire. Make fire. Share fire.

OOGA BOOGA.
